k:title="pdf" xlink:href="jcb1761073.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Vol. 176 No. 5, February 26, 2007. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="176" page="573" id="N0x9a08310N0x9b33118" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="17312025" ext-link-type="pubmed">573&#x02013;580</related-article>.</p><p>In the original version of Fig. S1 B, the color layers corresponding to Che-MIIA and GFP-MIIB were accidentally misaligned, resulting in a 15-pixel shift from magenta to green. The corrected version of the <xref rid="fig1" ref-type="fig">figure</xref> was posted online on March 1, 2007, and also appears below.</p><p><fig position="float" id="fig1"><label>Figure 1</label><graphic xlink:href="jcb1761073f01"></graphic></fig></p></body></article>